{"timestamp":"2026-08-16T01:53:08.268Z","ordinal":19863,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_00fb20eee1c75140016a811801d05881989905373336b1cb48","status":"completed","call_id":"call_I9VTGj6hLUd10oKlkCSjRmq3","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({\n  cmd: \"gh issue view 75 --json number,title,state,body,url,comments\",\n  workdir: \"/home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app\",\n  yield_time_ms: 10000,\n  max_output_tokens: 6000,\n  sandbox_permissions: \"require_escalated\",\n  justification: \"May I read the current GitHub issue #75 details so the refund pull request accurately describes this slice and the remaining roadmap work?\",\n  prefix_rule: [\"gh\", \"issue\", \"view\"]\n});\ntext(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a007af-dc2d-7273-a829-7d59e29dc4f8"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-16T01:53:12.735Z","ordinal":19864,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019ffe5b-1054-7c22-8afc-e97cb84c7b73","turn_id":"01a007af-dc2d-7273-a829-7d59e29dc4f8","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-7fcc9e63-1137-43f9-ab79-5e967451cca7","process_id":"99339","command":["/bin/bash","-lc","gh issue view 75 --json number,title,state,body,url,comments"],"cwd":"file:///home/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/travel-app","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh issue view 75 --json number,title,state,body,url,comments"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"{\"body\":\"Migrated from `REAL_WORLD_ROADMAP.md`.\\n\\n## Tasks\\n\\n- [ ] Select a payment provider and use hosted/tokenized card components.\\n- [ ] Ensure the application never receives or stores raw card numbers or CVVs.\\n- [ ] Add authorization, capture, failure, retry, refund, and reconciliation states.\\n- [ ] Verify signed webhooks and handle duplicate/out-of-order delivery.\\n- [ ] Add receipts and customer-safe payment history.\\n\\n## Acceptance criteria\\n\\n- A booking is confirmed only after the required payment state is established.\\n- Webhook handling is idempotent and tested.\\n- No raw payment-card data appears in application state, requests, logs, or the database.\\n\",\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOOKAPdM8AAAABO-mzuw\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"scottdensmore\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"PR #276 merged the first independently shippable payment slice:\\n\\n- authenticated, strict server action for starting checkout payment\\n- server-authoritative itinerary pricing and live seat/cabin validation\\n- durable PaymentAttempt metadata and stable Stripe idempotency\\n- manual-capture PaymentIntent creation without storing raw card data or client secrets\\n- migration constraints, reconciliation retention, leak tracking, and focused coverage\\n\\nRemaining for #75:\\n\\n- render Stripe Elements and confirm the PaymentIntent\\n- gate booking creation on authoritative payment state and capture\\n- signed, idempotent webhook processing for duplicate/out-of-order delivery\\n- cancellation, retry, refund, and reconciliation workflows\\n- receipts and customer-safe payment history\\n\\nThe issue remains open for those later slices.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T02:43:35Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/scottdensmore/travel-app/issues/75#issuecomment-5300138939\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOOKAPdM8AAAABPCSPSQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"scottdensmore\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"PR #279 merged the fourth independently shippable payment slice. The merged #75 work now includes:\\n\\n- #276 — durable, idempotent server-side Stripe authorization with server-authoritative pricing and no raw card data\\n- #277 — signed, idempotent webhook reconciliation for duplicate and out-of-order delivery\\n- #278 — hosted Stripe payment fields and checkout authorization without application-owned card entry\\n- #279 — booking-to-PaymentIntent linkage, exact idempotent capture, abandoned-authorization cancellation, interrupted-response recovery, and truthful retry UI that does not authorize twice\\n\\nRemaining for #75:\\n\\n- refund workflows and their failure/retry states\\n- receipts and customer-safe payment history\\n- any broader operational reconciliation/retry tooling needed beyond the durable webhook and capture recovery paths already merged\\n\\nThe issue remains open for those later slices.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T20:03:01Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/scottdensmore/travel-app/issues/75#issuecomment-5303996233\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true}],\"number\":75,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"P2.3 Integrate real payments safely\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/scottdensmore/travel-app/issues/75\"}\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"{\"body\":\"Migrated from `REAL_WORLD_ROADMAP.md`.\\n\\n## Tasks\\n\\n- [ ] Select a payment provider and use hosted/tokenized card components.\\n- [ ] Ensure the application never receives or stores raw card numbers or CVVs.\\n- [ ] Add authorization, capture, failure, retry, refund, and reconciliation states.\\n- [ ] Verify signed webhooks and handle duplicate/out-of-order delivery.\\n- [ ] Add receipts and customer-safe payment history.\\n\\n## Acceptance criteria\\n\\n- A booking is confirmed only after the required payment state is established.\\n- Webhook handling is idempotent and tested.\\n- No raw payment-card data appears in application state, requests, logs, or the database.\\n\",\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOOKAPdM8AAAABO-mzuw\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"scottdensmore\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"PR #276 merged the first independently shippable payment slice:\\n\\n- authenticated, strict server action for starting checkout payment\\n- server-authoritative itinerary pricing and live seat/cabin validation\\n- durable PaymentAttempt metadata and stable Stripe idempotency\\n- manual-capture PaymentIntent creation without storing raw card data or client secrets\\n- migration constraints, reconciliation retention, leak tracking, and focused coverage\\n\\nRemaining for #75:\\n\\n- render Stripe Elements and confirm the PaymentIntent\\n- gate booking creation on authoritative payment state and capture\\n- signed, idempotent webhook processing for duplicate/out-of-order delivery\\n- cancellation, retry, refund, and reconciliation workflows\\n- receipts and customer-safe payment history\\n\\nThe issue remains open for those later slices.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T02:43:35Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/scottdensmore/travel-app/issues/75#issuecomment-5300138939\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOOKAPdM8AAAABPCSPSQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"scottdensmore\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"PR #279 merged the fourth independently shippable payment slice. The merged #75 work now includes:\\n\\n- #276 — durable, idempotent server-side Stripe authorization with server-authoritative pricing and no raw card data\\n- #277 — signed, idempotent webhook reconciliation for duplicate and out-of-order delivery\\n- #278 — hosted Stripe payment fields and checkout authorization without application-owned card entry\\n- #279 — booking-to-PaymentIntent linkage, exact idempotent capture, abandoned-authorization cancellation, interrupted-response recovery, and truthful retry UI that does not authorize twice\\n\\nRemaining for #75:\\n\\n- refund workflows and their failure/retry states\\n- receipts and customer-safe payment history\\n- any broader operational reconciliation/retry tooling needed beyond the durable webhook and capture recovery paths already merged\\n\\nThe issue remains open for those later slices.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T20:03:01Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/scottdensmore/travel-app/issues/75#issuecomment-5303996233\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true}],\"number\":75,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"P2.3 Integrate real payments safely\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/scottdensmore/travel-app/issues/75\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":372002486},"formatted_output":"{\"body\":\"Migrated from `REAL_WORLD_ROADMAP.md`.\\n\\n## Tasks\\n\\n- [ ] Select a payment provider and use hosted/tokenized card components.\\n- [ ] Ensure the application never receives or stores raw card numbers or CVVs.\\n- [ ] Add authorization, capture, failure, retry, refund, and reconciliation states.\\n- [ ] Verify signed webhooks and handle duplicate/out-of-order delivery.\\n- [ ] Add receipts and customer-safe payment history.\\n\\n## Acceptance criteria\\n\\n- A booking is confirmed only after the required payment state is established.\\n- Webhook handling is idempotent and tested.\\n- No raw payment-card data appears in application state, requests, logs, or the database.\\n\",\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOOKAPdM8AAAABO-mzuw\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"scottdensmore\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"PR #276 merged the first independently shippable payment slice:\\n\\n- authenticated, strict server action for starting checkout payment\\n- server-authoritative itinerary pricing and live seat/cabin validation\\n- durable PaymentAttempt metadata and stable Stripe idempotency\\n- manual-capture PaymentIntent creation without storing raw card data or client secrets\\n- migration constraints, reconciliation retention, leak tracking, and focused coverage\\n\\nRemaining for #75:\\n\\n- render Stripe Elements and confirm the PaymentIntent\\n- gate booking creation on authoritative payment state and capture\\n- signed, idempotent webhook processing for duplicate/out-of-order delivery\\n- cancellation, retry, refund, and reconciliation workflows\\n- receipts and customer-safe payment history\\n\\nThe issue remains open for those later slices.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T02:43:35Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/scottdensmore/travel-app/issues/75#issuecomment-5300138939\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOOKAPdM8AAAABPCSPSQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"scottdensmore\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"PR #279 merged the fourth independently shippable payment slice. The merged #75 work now includes:\\n\\n- #276 — durable, idempotent server-side Stripe authorization with server-authoritative pricing and no raw card data\\n- #277 — signed, idempotent webhook reconciliation for duplicate and out-of-order delivery\\n- #278 — hosted Stripe payment fields and checkout authorization without application-owned card entry\\n- #279 — booking-to-PaymentIntent linkage, exact idempotent capture, abandoned-authorization cancellation, interrupted-response recovery, and truthful retry UI that does not authorize twice\\n\\nRemaining for #75:\\n\\n- refund workflows and their failure/retry states\\n- receipts and customer-safe payment history\\n- any broader operational reconciliation/retry tooling needed beyond the durable webhook and capture recovery paths already merged\\n\\nThe issue remains open for those later slices.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T20:03:01Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/scottdensmore/travel-app/issues/75#issuecomment-5303996233\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true}],\"number\":75,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"P2.3 Integrate real payments safely\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/scottdensmore/travel-app/issues/75\"}\n"},"started_at_ms":1786845192362,"completed_at_ms":1786845192735}}
