hose later slices.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T02:43:35Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/scottdensmore/travel-app/issues/75#issuecomment-5300138939\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOOKAPdM8AAAABPCSPSQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"scottdensmore\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"PR #279 merged the fourth independently shippable payment slice. The merged #75 work now includes:\\n\\n- #276 — durable, idempotent server-side Stripe authorization with server-authoritative pricing and no raw card data\\n- #277 — signed, idempotent webhook reconciliation for duplicate and out-of-order delivery\\n- #278 — hosted Stripe payment fields and checkout authorization without application-owned card entry\\n- #279 — booking-to-PaymentIntent linkage, exact idempotent capture, abandoned-authorization cancellation, interrupted-response recovery, and truthful retry UI that does not authorize twice\\n\\nRemaining for #75:\\n\\n- refund workflows and their failure/retry states\\n- receipts and customer-safe payment history\\n- any broader operational reconciliation/retry tooling needed beyond the durable webhook and capture recovery paths already merged\\n\\nThe issue remains open for those later slices.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T20:03:01Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/scottdensmore/travel-app/issues/75#issuecomment-5303996233\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true}],\"number\":75,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"P2.3 Integrate real payments safely\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/scottdensmore/travel-app/issues/75\"}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a007af-dc2d-7273-a829-7d59e29dc4f8"}}}
